# Honest capability

If a feature cannot run safely yet: keep the abstraction, API contract, and UI, and return a configured/unavailable error. Do not silently invent AI replies, search hits, or analysis results.

Mock providers are isolated and enabled only by `ENABLE_MOCK_AI=true`.
Do not execute AI-generated code inside the Express process.
When a model lacks a capability (vision, tools, image generation), disable the control and explain why.